Built for retail and e-commerce

Items, sales invoices, purchase costs and expenses. A clean daily picture without a separate POS spreadsheet.

See it → {{site}}

Real project profitability

Link invoices, expenses, payroll and purchases to a project. See the actual margin, not the number someone typed into a deck.

